00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:56.410
I have to go edit this video,
pack and head to Cupertino.

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:57.530
I just went through this whole video

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:59.900
and now I'm thinking about how crazy it is

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:01.854
because when I was younger,
this was literally my dream.

00:10:01.854 --> 00:10:03.930
My dream was to, well,

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:05.940
number one my dream was
to go and work at Apple,

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:07.480
but I never really realized

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:09.200
that there would be something
else that I could do

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:11.080
and sort of cover Apple Tech.

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:13.500
I dunno, I was a child, I had no idea.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.300
Again, I mean, the internet, and you guys,

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:18.130
have made my small
childhood dreams come true.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:19.840
So I just honestly, I
can't thank you enough,

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:21.700
and I look forward to giving
you guys some coverage

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:24.210
and if there's anything else
that you would like to know,

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:25.270
if you have any questions,

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:26.500
leave those in the comments below.

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:29.520
Everybody here is
usually super supportive,

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:30.860
and I love hearing from you guys,

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:34.460
so thanks for being an
incredible community, I love you.

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.750
Hashtag, IJ...

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:38.278
I don't, what's my hashtag?

00:10:38.278 --> 00:10:39.240
Do I have a hashtag?

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:40.073
Team IJ?

00:10:40.073 --> 00:10:41.970
It used to be IJ Army,
should we stick with that?

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:44.313
I think we'll stick with that, peace out.

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:46.990
There's a new Guayaje flavor.

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:49.733
It's sparkling blackberry mint.

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:52.930
Color me freaking impressed.

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:54.480
I'll see you guys in Cupertino.

00:10:56.448 --> 00:10:59.865
(chill electronic music)

